@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Customer ERP -> CRM
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/erp/customers/CUST-1001/sync

### Product bulk ERP -> CRM
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/erp/products/bulk-sync

### Order ERP -> CRM
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/erp/orders/SO-2026-0001/sync

### Delivery ERP -> CRM
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/erp/deliveries/DLV-2026-0001/sync

### Mock Salesforce state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/crm-state

### Integration history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/erp/sync-history

### CRM -> ERP Quote + Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/crm/quote-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quote": {
    "quoteNo": "Q-2026-1000",
    "customerCode": "CUST-1002",
    "quoteDate": "2026-09-29",
    "status": "APPROVED",
    "items": [{"lineNo": 1, "productCode": "PRD-001", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 120000}]
  },
  "order": {
    "orderNo": "SO-2026-1000",
    "quoteNo": "Q-2026-1000",
    "customerCode": "CUST-1002",
    "orderDate": "2026-09-29",
    "status": "CONFIRMED",
    "totalAmount": 120000,
    "items": [{"lineNo": 1, "productCode": "PRD-001", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 120000}]
  }
}
